Officers of the University

ORDINANCE LXX OF 2002
GOVERNMENT COLLEGE
UNIVERSITY,
FAISALABAD
ORDINANCE, 2002
ORDINANCE LXX OF 2002
An Ordinance to provide for the establishment Of the Government College
University, Faisalabad
[Gazette of Punjab,
Extraordinary, 19th October, 2002]
No.Legis.13-53/2002, dated
19-10-2002.----The following Ordinance promulgated by the Governor of the
Punjab is hereby published for general information:
8. Officers of the
University.--The following shall be the officers of the University:-
(i) the Chancellor;
(ii) the Vice-Chancellor;
(iii) the Deans;
(iv) the Associate Deans;
(v) the Directors of Institutes;
(vi) the Principals University
colleges;
(vii) the Chairman of Academic
Departments;
(viii) the Registrar;
(ix) the Treasurer;
(x) the Controller of Examinations;
(xi) the Librarian; and
(xii) such other persons as may
be prescribed to be officers.
